    "no_subset_selection": "every attempted repetition is reported; an invalid, failed or inconclusive run is never dropped or replaced; added repetitions supplement it",
    "acceptance_boundary": "an I5 result shows that the instrument captured a runtime; it is not A1-A18 acceptance. Throughput verdicts between the ADR baseline and post-I1 main are informational because I1 has no request-path enforcement"
